      "excerpt": "Movers presents an evening celebrating the reissue of Matthew Collin’s legendary book \"Altered State: The Story of Ecstasy Culture and Acid House (Deep Cuts)\" via White Rabbit. Join Truth & Lies’ Justin Turford in conversation with Matthew Collin as together they trace the stories, politics and cultural shifts surrounding acid house, ecstasy culture and the underground scenes that changed Britain forever. Expect conversations, book signings and DJs taking things late into the night at Movers. FR",
      "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1780490347111\" id=\"item-6a201ef1eb75fa727bdad000\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-64deae6a3efae39cb10c\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Movers presents an evening celebrating the reissue of Matthew Collin’s legendary book \"Altered State: The Story of Ecstasy Culture and Acid House (Deep Cuts)\" via White Rabbit. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Join Justin Turford (DJ &amp; Journalist) in conversation with Matthew Collin as together they trace the stories, politics and cultural shifts surrounding acid house, ecstasy culture and the underground scenes that changed Britain forever. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Expect conversations, book signings and DJs taking things late into the night at Movers. FREE ENTRY!</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Movers, 15 Hockley, Nottingham NG1 1FH</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-embed embed-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.embed/8e684f9d-ccbd-40b6-a41a-c1e90f28f687_379/website.components.embed.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.embed/8e684f9d-ccbd-40b6-a41a-c1e90f28f687_379/website.components.embed.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.embed\" data-sqsp-block=\"embed\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_17804898797